          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: var(--text-color, #333); background-color: var(--bg-color, #fafafa); padding: 12px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n    <h4 style=\"color: var(--heading-color, #4db6ac); margin-bottom: 10px;\">What this chart shows:</h4>\n    <p>\n        This chart displays the <span style=\"color: var(--highlight-color, #81c784); font-weight:bold;\">daily bug creation count</span> for teams in the DEMO project, showing how many bugs each team created per day over the selected time period.\n    </p>\n    <ul style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">\n        <li><strong>Time Series:</strong> Daily aggregation of bug creation activity</li>\n        <li><strong>Team Breakdown:</strong> Each line represents a different team showing their individual bug creation patterns</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h4 style=\"color: var(--heading-color, #4db6ac); margin-bottom: 10px;\">Why it matters:</h4>\n    <ul style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">\n        <li>Track bug discovery trends and identify periods of high bug reporting activity</li>\n        <li>Monitor individual team member contributions to quality assurance efforts</li>\n        <li>Identify patterns in bug creation that may correlate with development cycles or releases</li>\n        <li>Support workload analysis and team performance insights</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h4 style=\"color: var(--heading-color, #4db6ac); margin-bottom: 10px;\">Filters applied:</h4>\n    <ul style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">\n        <li><strong>Project:</strong> Limited to 'DEMO' project items</li>\n        <li><strong>Item Type:</strong> Only 'Bug' type items are included</li>\n        <li><strong>Date Range:</strong> Filtered by dashboard time range parameters</li>\n        <li><strong>Teams:</strong> Filtered by selected team(s)</li>\n    </ul>\n\n</div>\n",
        "mode": "html"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.1.1",
      "type": "text"
    },
